<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine bolsa approves Banco Mayo $50 mln bond.</title>
<headline>Argentine bolsa approves Banco Mayo $50 mln bond.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina's Banco Mayo has been authorized to list medium-term negotiable bonds for $50 million as part of a wider issue of $75 million, the Buenos Aires Stock Exchange said Monday.</p>
<p>The bonds mature in June 1999. They have a reoffer price of 99.97 percent plus accrued interest if applicable.</p>
<p>The issue carries a fix annual rate of 9.125 percent, payable half-yearly.</p>
<p>((-Guillermo Haskel, Buenos Aires newsroom, 541 318-0650))</p>
